    "text": "21 hours ago The American Association is one of the independent MLB Partner Leagues that fill in the gaps across the continent not covered by affiliated baseball. Founded in 2005, the league’s dozen teams stretch geographically in a midwestern corridor from Manitoba to Texas. The level of play in the circuit is generally comparable to the High-A level of affiliated ball. Read full article",
